  checkpoint {
    user_intent: "Admin Panel Development\nThe user wants to develop and manage the admin panel for the SEPRI Distrito 22 application. This includes:\n- Implementing an admin login system.\n- Managing news articles (creating, editing, deleting).\n- Managing event protocols (creating, editing, deleting).\n- Configuring system settings, including:\n    - Pop-up notifications.\n    - Quick links for the footer.\n    - Team member profiles.\n    - Visual identity elements (logo, hero image).\n    - Contact information.\n    - Google Gemini API key for the AI chat.\n    - Privacy policy content.\n- Ensuring all changes are saved correctly."
